### Fetching one book – OK (200)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/books/1
Accept: application/json

### Fetching one book – Not Found (404)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/books/99999
Accept: application/json

### Deleting one book – No Content (204)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/books/1
Accept: application/json

### Deleting one book – Not Found (404)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/books/99999
Accept: application/json

### Filtering Books – OK (200)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/books/filter?fields=title&fields=author&query=Homer
Accept: application/json

### Filtering Books – Bad Request (400)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/books/filter?fields=title&query=
Accept: application/json

### Creating a Book – Created (201)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/books
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "isbn": "978-1234567890",
  "title": "Clean Architecture",
  "author": "Robert C. Martin",
  "publicationDate": "2017-09-20",
  "pages": 432,
  "price": 29.99,
  "genre": "NON_FICTION",
  "available": true,
  "coverImageUrl": "https://example.com/cover.jpg",
  "location": "B2",
  "comic": false
}

### Creating a Book – Validation Error (400)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/books
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "isbn": "",
  "title": "",
  "author": "",
  "publicationDate": "2030-01-01",
  "pages": -10,
  "price": -5,
  "genre": null,
  "coverImageUrl": "invalid-url",
  "location": ""
}

### Updating a Book – OK (200)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/books/1
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "isbn": "978-0312866693",
  "title": "The Odyssey - Updated",
  "author": "Homer",
  "publicationDate": "1996-11-01",
  "pages": 600,
  "price": 14.99,
  "genre": "FICTION",
  "available": true,
  "coverImageUrl": "https://example.com/odyssey.jpg",
  "location": "A3",
  "comic": false
}

### Updating a Book – Not Found (404)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/books/9999
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "isbn": "978-1111111111",
  "title": "Ghost Book",
  "author": "Nobody",
  "publicationDate": "2000-01-01",
  "pages": 100,
  "price": 10,
  "genre": "FICTION",
  "available": true,
  "coverImageUrl": "https://example.com/test.jpg",
  "location": "Z9",
  "comic": false
}

### Checkout Details – OK (200)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/books/1/checkout
Accept: application/json

### Checkout Details – No Content (204)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/books/6/checkout
Accept: application/json

### Checkout Details – Not Found (404)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/books/9999/checkout
Accept: application/json